    <h2><u>What is nevermore?</u></h2>
    <p>Nevermore is a Sapphic Webtoon following Lenore Vandernacht as she guides through the inbetween of death and life. The two characters Lenore & Annabel Lee arrive in a strange location where they end up meeting eachother not knowing who they are or what they are doing, as a means of escaping from the souls flying around that they meet at the start they enter a gated location, where they are then forced to go into Nevermore Academy by the Deans. They at first don't remember much, however, they felt they knew eachother in there past lives so they made a deal to help each other escape from the academy to get another chance at life. However, the plan wasn't going so well as at first Lenore did not understand but Annabel Lee was already putting in the pieces to controlling the people in the academy. While Lenore finds out she finds her own friend group with people she trust and Lenore and Annabel Lee get into a disagreement about whether they should include there friends in the plan.</p>
